{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"746939431696728086","content":"@everyone New Exclusive Campaign!\nWhen: Thursdays 6:30-8:30 from March 4th - May 27th\n\nHello fellow DMs and Mods. Empire City is less than 5 months away, if you can believe it. And there is still a lot of work to be done. With so many DM’s this season, it’s important for us to keep talking. That’s why I’m running a short preparatory campaign from March through the end of May. This will give many of us the excuse we need to actually meet together and interact with each other. I’ll cover the rules of the game below, but the whole point of this game is to get us GM’s talking. The game is open to all the GMs and mods participating in Empire City. It’s a weekly game every Thursday evening from 6:30 - 8:30 PM PST. After each gaming session, I hope you will continue talking with each other, and write your stories and NPCs together for Empire City.","created_at":"2021-02-20T02:52:11.190000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"812516926827659304","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"746939431696728086","content":"god i want to do this but also i play too much dnd already","created_at":"2021-02-20T04:58:57.411000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"812548829631086604","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"746939431696728086","content":"@everyone Regarding my mini-campaign, if you can’t make it to each session, don’t worry. Jump in when you can. I plan this as more of an episodic adventure of the week where different groups can set out to face whatever threatens the community. Right now, I’m only opening the game to DMs and Mods, since there will be shop talk and spoilers. I’m only planning on running for 2 hours each week. Before and after can be for planning Empire City. The campaign will end in May so that everyone has at least a month off for promoting Empire City and resting. \n\nI'm hosting the game in \"Tales From Arcania\" in a hidden channel. Send me a direct message, and I'll open it up for you. First game will be on Thursday, March 4th at 6:30pm PST. If you are seeing this message, you are invited.","created_at":"2021-02-21T04:07:14.708000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"812898203816558592","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
