{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"746939431696728086","content":"@everyone I'd like to send out another invite for folks who want to play in my pre-Empire City campaign. It starts this Thursday, March 4th on the Tales from Arcania server https://discord.gg/NrJKQYPU \nThe channel is secret, so let me know here or privately if you want to play. The game will go for approx. 12 weeks. Then we will break for Empire City. You are all welcome to join.","created_at":"2021-03-03T04:12:50.481000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"816523490806857748","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"746939431696728086","content":"@everyone As we start to get near to game day (we have already been through about 3/4's of the year. People will start to get anxious. A few of you have already mentioned it to me. I get anxious about this time of year too, and it is toally normal. The best advice I can give you is to talk to one another. To rely on one another and to take this time to start depending on one another and make the choice to be dependable for one another. We work better as a group that loves and cares for one another. Nerves are normal and fine. Feeling it with out talking about it will just make things worse.","created_at":"2021-03-16T01:32:12.096000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"821194106742374420","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
